        <item>
            <title>0.2.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:48:38 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/thaw-app/Floe/releases/tag/0.2.0</link>
            <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p><strong>macOS 26 and later · Build 3</strong></p>
<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Floe runs on Intel Macs, extensions included</strong> (<a href="https://github.com/thaw-app/Floe/issues/46" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/thaw-app/Floe/issues/46/hovercard">#46</a>).</li>
<li><strong>Choose the screen the launcher opens on</strong>, in Settings &gt; Appearance &gt; Layout. Until you pick one, and whenever the one you picked is not connected, it opens on the screen with the pointer (<a href="https://github.com/thaw-app/Floe/discussions/41">#41</a>).</li>
</ul>
<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Ask AI with Codex needs Codex 0.157.1 or later.</strong> Older versions can start their MCP servers even when Floe turns them off.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Extensions that use <code class="notranslate">ws</code>'s server or streams load again.</strong> A named import such as <code class="notranslate">WebSocketServer</code> failed in 0.1.1.</li>
<li><strong>Shell path completion keeps going inside a folder whose name has a space or brackets</strong>, such as <code class="notranslate">~/Photos\ \(2024\)/</code>.</li>
<li><strong>Floe stays open when Settings closes as it starts.</strong> It could quit without a word.</li>
</ul>
<h4>Security</h4>
<ul>
<li><strong>An extension's encrypted database is refused however its schema is named.</strong> A name with a space or an accent got past the check, and the data was written unencrypted.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Contributors</h3>
<ul>
<li><a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/BYIIHub/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/BYIIHub">@BYIIHub</a> asked for Intel support (<a href="https://github.com/thaw-app/Floe/issues/46" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/thaw-app/Floe/issues/46/hovercard">#46</a>).</li>
<li><a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Dent13/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Dent13">@Dent13</a> asked to choose the screen the launcher opens on (<a href="https://github.com/thaw-app/Floe/discussions/41">#41</a>).</li>
</ul>]]></description>
